You can further customize utility output with USWDS settings. Add settings from the table below to your `uswds-core` module initialization. For more information on configuring USWDS settings, visit the [settings page]( /documentation/settings#configuring-settings-maps). Here's an example:

 {:.margin-bottom-4}
 ```scss
@use "uswds-core" with (
 $utilities-use-important: true,
 $output-these-utilities:(
 "background-color",
 "color",
 "display",
 "margin",
 "padding",
 ),
 $theme-utility-breakpoints: (
 "mobile-lg": false,
 ),
 $color-settings: (
 "hover": false,
 ),
 $color-palettes: (
 "palette-color-theme"
 ),
);
 ```
